### Create Customer
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/create_customer/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Ben",
  "last_name": "Stokes",
  "dob": "25-06-1991"
}

### Create Customer
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/create_customer/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "first_name": "Vijay",
  "last_name": "Surwase",
  "dob": "29-09-1990"
}

### Search Customer by first_name
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/customer/?first_name=Ben

### Search Customer by last_name
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/customer/?last_name=Surwase

### Create Quote (replace customer_id with actual UUID from create_customer response)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/quote/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": "9603d34b-81b6-4d0d-84fd-555aa38b4cca",
  "type": "personal-accident"
}

### Update Quote State (replace policy_id with actual UUID from create quote response)
PATCH http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/quote/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "policy_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
  "status": "bound"
}

### List All Policies
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/policies/

### List Policies by customer_id
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/policies/?customer_id=9603d34b-81b6-4d0d-84fd-555aa38b4cca

### List Policies by type
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/policies/?type=personal-accident

### Get Policy Details (replace policy_id with actual UUID)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/policies/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890/

### Get Policy State History (replace policy_id with actual UUID)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/policies/a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890/history/
